<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include(`${partials}/head`, {
  noGlobalScripts: true,
  pageMeta: {
    title: 'SemiVault Farms on Robinhood Chain | vfat.tools',
    description: 'Live SemiVault staking TVL, realised emission APR, and direct wallet actions on Robinhood Chain. Every value comes from the official RPC and onchain contracts.',
    url: 'https://vfat.tools/robinhood/semi/',
    image: 'https://vfat.tools/img/robinhood-semi-social.png',
    imageAlt: 'Live vfat.tools SemiVault staking table on Robinhood Chain.',
    imageWidth: 1200,
    imageHeight: 630
  }
}); -%>

<body>
<%- include(`${partials}/header_main`); -%>
<pre id="semi-banner">
***************** 👨‍🌾 UNOFFICIAL SEMIVAULT STAKING CALCULATOR 👨‍🌾 *****************
INFO  : https://semivault.xyz
CHAIN : Robinhood Chain (4663)
MODE  : Wallet-only onchain reads and direct wallet transactions. No price API or router.
NOTE  : Emissions are conditional. The ratchet mints to stakers only when the
        backing ratio sets a new high, so the APR shown is a REALISED trailing
        average, not a promised rate. Some epochs pay nothing.
**************************************************************************************

</pre>
<div id="semi-loading" class="semi-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span id="semi-loading-spinner" class="semi-spinner" aria-hidden="true">[....]</span> <span id="semi-loading-text">Reading SemiVault contracts on Robinhood Chain…</span>
</div>
<div id="semi-app" aria-live="polite"></div>
<%- include(`${partials}/disclaimer`); -%>
<style>
  .semi-action { margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }
  .semi-action:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .45; text-decoration: none; }
  .semi-loading { padding: 10px 0; }
  .semi-loading[hidden] { display: none; }
  .semi-spinner { display: inline-block; width: 6ch; }
  .semi-form-label { display: block; margin: 7px 0; }
  .semi-form-label input { margin-left: 8px; font: inherit; }
  #semi-app, #semi-app section { min-width: 0; }
  #semi-banner, #semi-app pre { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; }
  #semi-banner, #semi-app pre:not(.semi-market-table) { overflow-wrap: anywhere; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .semi-market-table { overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; }
</style>
<%- include(`${partials}/scripts_onchain`, {scriptname: 'robinhood_semi'}); -%>
</body>
</html>
